{"event":"step_update","step_update":{"conversation_id":"356a30a1-f4a2-4b31-9c68-2cd44f412d2f","step_index":67,"state":"DONE","step_type":"tool","tool_name":"run_command","duration_seconds":0.145261192,"tool_info":{"name":"run_command","parameters":{"CommandLine":"head -n 10 audit/findings/F-022.md audit/findings/F-035.md audit/findings/F-074.md audit/findings/F-106.md"},"output":"Created At: 2026-11-20T13:58:09+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-11-20T13:58:09+05:30\nCommand exited with code 0.\n\nCommand output:\n==\u003e audit/findings/F-022.md \u003c==\r\n# Finding F-022: Absence of Audit Logging Across Operational Mutations and Administrative Actions\r\n\r\n**ID**: F-022  \r\n**Title**: `auditService.log` is invoked only on report exports; zero audit log records are generated for orders, dispatches, production runs, invoices, or payments  \r\n**Severity**: P1  \r\n**Category**: Security Logging \u0026 Monitoring / Non-Repudiation  \r\n**Standard Refs**: OWASP Top 10:2021 A09:2021 (Security Logging and Monitoring Failures), OWASP ASVS v4.0.3 Section 8.2 (Audit Logging Requirements), REQ-050  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n\r\n==\u003e audit/findings/F-035.md \u003c==\r\n# Finding F-035: Absence of API Request Logging, Missing Correlation IDs, and Mutable Database Audit Log\r\n\r\n**ID**: F-035  \r\n**Title**: Zero HTTP request logging middleware exists; no correlation IDs are generated; operational mutations bypass audit logs; and `audit_log` records are mutable and lack search/export UI  \r\n**Severity**: P1  \r\n**Category**: Security Logging \u0026 Monitoring / Non-Repudiation / Data Integrity  \r\n**Standard Refs**: OWASP Top 10:2021 A09:2021 (Security Logging and Monitoring Failures), OWASP ASVS v4.0.3 Sec 8.2, Sec 8.3.1, REQ-050  \r\n**Status**: OPEN  \r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n==\u003e audit/findings/F-074.md \u003c==\r\n# F-074: Absence of Server Pagination and List Virtualization Across All Enterprise Entity Grids\r\n\r\n- **ID**: F-074\r\n- **Title**: Absence of Server Pagination and List Virtualization Across All Enterprise Entity Grids\r\n- **Severity**: P1\r\n- **Category**: Network \u0026 UI Scalability / DOM Performance\r\n- **Standard Refs**:\r\n  - OWASP API Security Top 10:2023 API4:2023 (Unrestricted Resource Consumption)\r\n  - NN/g Heuristic #8: Aesthetic and minimalist design / System performance\r\n\r\n\r\n==\u003e audit/findings/F-106.md \u003c==\r\n# F-106: Lack of Data Protection Policies, Retention Schedules, Erasure/Anonymization Routines, and Subject Access Export Under DPDP Act 2023\r\n\r\n- **ID**: F-106\r\n- **Title**: Lack of Data Protection Policies, Retention Schedules, Erasure/Anonymization Routines, and Subject Access Export Under DPDP Act 2023\r\n- **Severity**: P2\r\n- **Category**: Data Protection \u0026 Privacy Compliance\r\n- **Standard Refs**:\r\n  - Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (DPDP Act 2023, Act No. 22 of 2023, Sections 11 \u0026 12)\r\n  - Central Goods and Services Tax Act, 2017 (CGST Act 2017, Section 36 - Retention of Accounts)\r\n  - ISO/IEC 27701:2019 (Privacy Information Management)\r\n"}}}
