{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"356a30a1-f4a2-4b31-9c68-2cd44f412d2f","status":"SUCCESS","response":"### Cluster Verification Summary: CLUSTER-03 (F-009)\n\n| Item | Verdict | Strongest Evidence | Surviving Mutants | New Issues Found |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| **F-009** | **REJECTED** | [02-original-repro.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/02-original-repro.txt#L28-L48)\u003cbr\u003e[05-adversarial-probes.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/05-adversarial-probes.txt#L10-L16) | Mutant 3 (Removal of `sales_invoice_line` trigger survived due to 0 line tests in test suite) | None (Syntax crash and status bypass are regressions in fix commit `af12729`; mutable `audit_log` tracked under F-035) |\n\n---\n\n### Verification Step Results\n\n1. **Fresh Environment**: **PASS**  \n   Checkout into a clean worktree from commit `af12729`, clean install with frozen lockfile, fresh PostgreSQL database `mill_ledger_fresh_f009`, and migrations 1–3 applied cleanly.  \n   *Evidence*: [01-fresh-environment.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/01-fresh-environment.txt)\n\n2. **Original Repro**: **FAIL**  \n   - `stock_movement` UPDATE and DELETE were blocked as expected.  \n   - `sales_invoice_line` trigger `enforce_sales_invoice_line_immutability()` in [migration.sql](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/server/prisma/migrations/20261120000002_ledger_immutability_triggers/migration.sql#L81) executes:  \n     `SELECT status INTO v_status FROM \"sales_invoice\" WHERE id = COALESCE(OLD.\"salesInvoiceId\", NEW.\"salesInvoiceId\");`  \n     Table `sales_invoice_line` has column `\"invoiceId\"`, not `\"salesInvoiceId\"`. Any UPDATE or DELETE query on `sales_invoice_line` immediately crashes PostgreSQL with `ERROR: record \"old\" has no field \"salesInvoiceId\"`. Valid DRAFT line modifications fail with an unhandled database exception.  \n   *Evidence*: [02-original-repro.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/02-original-repro.txt#L28-L48)\n\n3. **Test Validity (Revert Check)**: **PASS**  \n   In scratch worktree with migrations applied up to baseline, [server/src/db-immutability.test.ts](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/server/src/db-immutability.test.ts) fails (exit code 1). Applying migration `20261120000002` causes the 4 tests to pass (exit code 0).  \n   *Evidence*: [03-test-validity.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/03-test-validity.txt)\n\n4. **Mutation Check**: **FAIL**  \n   - Mutant A (allow `stock_movement` UPDATE) was killed by `db-immutability.test.ts`.  \n   - Mutant B (allow `totalAmount` UPDATE on posted invoice) was killed by `db-immutability.test.ts`.  \n   - **Mutant 3 (complete removal of `sales_invoice_line` immutability check)** **SURVIVED**. The fixer wrote 0 tests for `sales_invoice_line` in [server/src/db-immutability.test.ts](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/server/src/db-immutability.test.ts).  \n   *Evidence*: [04-mutation-check.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/04-mutation-check.txt#L127-L128), [04-mutation-check-file.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/04-mutation-check-file.txt)\n\n5. **Adversarial Probes**: **FAIL**  \n   - **Bypass via Status Downgrade**: `enforce_sales_invoice_immutability()` checks financial columns on `OLD.status IN ('POSTED', ...)` but does not guard transitions of `status` itself. Executing `UPDATE sales_invoice SET status = 'DRAFT' WHERE id = ...` succeeds (`UPDATE 1`). Once downgraded, `DELETE FROM sales_invoice WHERE id = ...` succeeds unconditionally (`DELETE 1`), destroying posted tax invoices without bypass privileges.  \n   - **Snapshot Tampering**: `customerNameSnapshot`, `companyGstinSnapshot`, and `deliveryStateSnapshot` are omitted from immutability checks on POSTED invoices.  \n   *Evidence*: [05-adversarial-probes.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/05-adversarial-probes.txt#L10-L28)\n\n6. **Sibling Sweep Audit**: **FAIL**  \n   Immutable operational tables `audit_log`, `payment`, `payment_allocation`, and `credit_note` have no PostgreSQL triggers or rules preventing direct UPDATE/DELETE. `DELETE FROM audit_log` succeeds without resistance. (Note: mutable `audit_log` is already tracked under F-035).  \n   *Evidence*: [06-sibling-sweep.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/06-sibling-sweep.txt#L29-L38)\n\n7. **Regression Radius**: **PASS**  \n   - CDI Benchmark: 18/18 assertions matched 100%.  \n   - SQL Invariants: 10/10 passing (0 rows returned).  \n   - Unit/Integration test suite: 22 files passed, 103 tests passed.  \n   - Typecheck and Lint: Clean.  \n   *Evidence*: [07-regression-radius.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/07-regression-radius.txt)\n\n8. **Diff Review**: **FAIL**  \n   Detailed in [08-diff-review.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/08-diff-review.txt). Highlights invalid column `salesInvoiceId`, status downgrade bypass, and zero line tests.\n\n9. **Standards Check**: **FAIL** (OWASP ASVS v4.0.3 Item 8.3.1 \u0026 10.3.2; MLD Core Rule).  \n   UI standards (WCAG, NN/g, Apple HIG) are `NOT-APPLICABLE` (database trigger only). Detailed in [09-standards-check.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/09-standards-check.txt).\n\n10. **Expected vs Actual**: Detailed in [10-expected-vs-actual.txt](file:///home/snehan/projects/web/mill-ledger/audit/evidence/verify/F-009/10-expected-vs-actual.txt).\n\n---\n\n### Tracker Status\n\n- `audit/tracker/tracker.json` updated with status `REJECTED`, complete evidence links, and verifier note.\n- `audit/tracker/tracker.md` regenerated via `node a